      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#0",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "We decided on batteries, and the regular chip would be necessary for the more advanced iPod-like button."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#1",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "It's been a little bit difficult to ensure that it's hand-holdable and easy to use, without being too big."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#2",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "We can do the evaluation separately and then discuss it."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#3",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "The microphones are unreliable when moving to the whiteboard and could drop off if moved too much."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#4",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The broccoli-shaped design is the preferred option."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#5",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "There is confusion about how to compute the average score—whether to sum the four scores and divide by four, and results vary."
